-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1000: an export with no GIVEN of its own, whose only input is
-- a section GIVEN, read once and overridden once.

§ `Rates`
    GIVEN r IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
inner MEANS r

@export Only a section GIVEN
GIVETH A NUMBER
outer MEANS inner PLUS (inner WITH r IS 100)
